      "url" : "https://twitter.com/maxandersen/status/1554450703430606849",
      "content" : "<p>yeah, I do something similar for my desks, using pegboards: <a href=\"https://xam.dk/blog/my-pegboardstanding-desk-installation/\">xam.dk/blog/my-pegboa…</a></p>\n\n<p>the challenge is to somehow have a durable flexible electric + ethernet cable to stay connected but not get  in the way….\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/alexsnaps\"></a></p>",
