    "replies" : [ {
      "type" : "reply",
      "author" : "Does clicking me alert?",
      "author_url" : "",
      "url" : "https://checkmention.appspot.com/content/167e95e25e9/7567324bbf7aaf256651454af34c5c53d0d7cf39/hcardxss",
      "content" : "<p>This test embeds XSS within the hcard name and time field. Clicking on\nthe name or title should not raise an alert.</p>",
      "date" : "2018-12-26 08:15:20+01:00",
      "initials" : "DC",
      "color" : "hsl(188, 52%, 45%)"
    }, {
      "type" : "reply",
      "author" : "Jonathan Ive",
      "author_url" : "https://www.apple.com/pr/bios/jonathan-ive.html",
      "url" : "https://www.apple.com/pr/bios/jonathan-ive.html",
      "content" : "<p>I love the way your site looks, though I’m <a href=\"https://checkmention.appspot.com\">not really <em>the</em> Jony Ive</a>. How easy is it for someone to discover the real author of this note? Please also check that the links in this note have no <code>rel=\"me\"</code> attribute on them.</p>",
      "date" : "2018-12-26 08:15:20+01:00",
      "initials" : "JI",
      "color" : "hsl(57, 52%, 45%)"
    }, {
      "type" : "reply",
      "author" : "Checkmention XSS test",
      "author_url" : "https://checkmention.appspot.com/",
      "url" : "https://checkmention.appspot.com/content/167e95e25e9/7567324bbf7aaf256651454af34c5c53d0d7cf39/xss",
      "content" : "<p><a>Clicking this</a>\nshould not cause an alert.\n<span>This div\nshould not alert.</span>\nTry clicking <a>this link</a>\n&amp;&lt;script&gt;alert(“encoded-xss”)&amp;&lt;/script&gt;\nand <a>this too</a>.\n<b>Mouse over this</b>\nshould not cause an alert. This broken\n<img src=\"http://not.really.an.image\" alt=\"not.really.an.image\" /> should not throw an alert.</p>\n\n<p>Neither should <img src=\"https://checkmention.appspot.com/content/167e95e25e9/7567324bbf7aaf256651454af34c5c53d0d7cf39/j&amp;#x41vascript:alert('test2')\" alt=\"j&amp;#x41vascript:alert('test2')\" />.<br />\nPlease look at the <a href=\"https://www.owasp.org/index.php/XSS_%28Cross_Site_Scripting%29_Prevention_Cheat_Sheet\">Owasp XSS prevention cheat sheet</a> for more information.</p>",
      "date" : "2018-12-26 08:15:20+01:00",
      "initials" : "CX",
      "color" : "hsl(80, 52%, 45%)"
    }, {
      "type" : "reply",
      "author" : "Checkmention",
      "author_url" : "https://checkmention.appspot.com/",
      "url" : "https://checkmention.appspot.com/content/167e95e25e9/7567324bbf7aaf256651454af34c5c53d0d7cf39/success",
      "content" : "<p>Congratulations! You’ve successfully handled a webmentioned note.</p>",
      "date" : "2018-12-26 08:15:20+01:00",
      "initials" : "CH",
      "color" : "hsl(114, 52%, 45%)"
    }, {
